  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Stiki Wiki Hot-Glue Gun (Made in Townston)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston.png)_128px.png\" title=\"Image:Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston)_128px.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston)_128px.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"256\" src=\"/images/recovered/Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston.png)_128px.png\" width=\"128\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Damage Type: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Slashing Damage\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Wielding: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">One-Handed?/<br/>Two-Handed?\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Attack Speed: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Ludicrous\n</td></tr></table>\n<p>This is not a real weapon as of yet.  It has been proposed to the Devs of DR, and has received enthusiastic approval both in concept and in name.  Unknown as to when it will be put in or if it will be 1-handed or 2-handed but it's destined for some artwork and probably model tweaks as well.\n</p><p>See <a href=\"/wiki/Talk/Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_%28Made_in_Townston%29\" title=\"Talk:Stiki Wiki Hot-Glue Gun (Made in Townston)\">discussion</a> for details.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Attributes:\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> Attributes: </span></h2>\n<ul><li> + Agility\n</li><li> + % Enemy Stun Chance\n</li><li> + % Ranged Critical Hit Chance\n</li><li> + % Ranged Attack Speed\n</li><li> + Fire Damage per Second to Weapon Attack\n</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n<a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston.png)_DISPLAY_400px.png\" title=\"image:Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston)_DISPLAY_400px.jpg\"><img alt=\"image:Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston)_DISPLAY_400px.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"333\" src=\"/images/recovered/Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston.png)_DISPLAY_400px.png\" width=\"400\"/></a>\n</p><p><br/>\n<a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston.png)_DISPLAY_400px.png\" title=\"image:Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston)_TOP_REAR_400px.jpg\"><img alt=\"image:Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston)_TOP_REAR_400px.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"346\" src=\"/images/recovered/Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston.png)_DISPLAY_400px.png\" width=\"400\"/></a>\n<a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston.png)_DISPLAY_400px.png\" title=\"image:Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston)_TOP_FRONT_400px.jpg\"><img alt=\"image:Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston)_TOP_FRONT_400px.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"305\" src=\"/images/recovered/Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston.png)_DISPLAY_400px.png\" width=\"400\"/></a>\n</p><p><br/>\n<a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston.png)_DISPLAY_400px.png\" title=\"image:Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston)_TOP_200x555px.jpg\"><img alt=\"image:Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston)_TOP_200x555px.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"555\" src=\"/images/recovered/Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston.png)_DISPLAY_400px.png\" width=\"200\"/></a>\n<a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston.png)_DISPLAY_400px.png\" title=\"image:Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston)_SIDE_VIEW_294x555px.jpg\"><img alt=\"image:Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston)_SIDE_VIEW_294x555px.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"555\" src=\"/images/recovered/Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston.png)_DISPLAY_400px.png\" width=\"294\"/></a>\n<a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston.png)_DISPLAY_400px.png\" title=\"image:Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston)_BOTTOM_200x555px.jpg\"><img alt=\"image:Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston)_BOTTOM_200x555px.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"555\" src=\"/images/recovered/Stiki_Wiki_Hot-Glue_Gun_(Made_in_Townston.png)_DISPLAY_400px.png\" width=\"200\"/></a>\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
